{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Execute</strong> is an active incremental game about reducing the world\u2019s population from 8 billion to zero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Name your execution pit</strong> \u2013 personalize the execution ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/633e453849699b45d90d44910c7c10a2.poster.avif?t=1759888554\" width=720 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/633e453849699b45d90d44910c7c10a2.webm?t=1759888554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/633e453849699b45d90d44910c7c10a2.mp4?t=1759888554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture people</strong> \u2013 gather victims for your machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/12d005883e7b86124e77fbf3eed0503c.poster.avif?t=1759888554\" width=720 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/12d005883e7b86124e77fbf3eed0503c.webm?t=1759888554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/12d005883e7b86124e77fbf3eed0503c.mp4?t=1759888554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Execute</strong> \u2013 start with a guillotine, then unlock new methods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/d7ca5050028eb26edfdf8d6cc921f452.poster.avif?t=1759888554\" width=720 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/d7ca5050028eb26edfdf8d6cc921f452.webm?t=1759888554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/d7ca5050028eb26edfdf8d6cc921f452.mp4?t=1759888554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand your arsenal</strong> \u2013 mines, contraptions, and machines that scale with your progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/5c73af91c9ac65785cc06a88b91f4e4b.poster.avif?t=1759888554\" width=720 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/5c73af91c9ac65785cc06a88b91f4e4b.webm?t=1759888554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/5c73af91c9ac65785cc06a88b91f4e4b.mp4?t=1759888554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade permanently</strong> \u2013 buy pit upgrades, reset, and start stronger each run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/5c22ebe784457d3ec2ebbcd78db756c8.poster.avif?t=1759888554\" width=720 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/5c22ebe784457d3ec2ebbcd78db756c8.webm?t=1759888554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3829620/extras/5c22ebe784457d3ec2ebbcd78db756c8.mp4?t=17598